title: FirstNPC
---
Hello! I am the first NPC!
Do you like apples?
    ->Yes
Hell yeah brother.
===
title: Carl_Butts
---
Carl: Can you check this stuff out please? And I need it for free. I have 200k on Martstragam
    -> I can't do that
    Carl: …Excuse me? Do you know who the fuck I am? Do you know how many promotions it took me to get here?? Give me my free stuff, or I’ll talk to the higher-ups
    -> Fine... Whatever (charge him anyway)
    Carl: Heh. That's what I thought.
===

title: Monica
---
Monica: (on the phone) Yeah, I got your damn groceries. 
Monica: Hold on, I need to pay… '
Monica: Aisle 129 residents are having a crazy food shortage. 
Monica: Just drove 40 minutes for this stuff!
    -> How is there a shortage?
    Monica: Fuck if I know guy, I'm not in charge.
    -> Okay
===
title: Chom
---
Chom: Beautiful day, isn’t it? 
Chom: You can tell by the AC blasting. 
Chom: It’s probably hot outside. 
Chom: Maybe they’ll replicate the weather inside someday!
    -> Maybe.
    Chom: That's the spirit! 
    -> Probably not 
    Chom: Oh... That makes me sad. 
===
title: Bigby
---
Bigby: What a day. I’ve been in the strawberry sector just de-seeding all day. My fingers are so cramped, alass thr higher-ups must have their seedless strawberries.
    -> Seedless strabwerries? 
    Bigby: Yup, a co-worker told me it was for their banquet. But what do we know? 
    -> Sheesh
===
title: Rafi
---
Rafi: Have you heard about the all-new item scanner for Malmart groceries? 
They’re 50% off right now in the technology sector! 
Please come buy one... I need the commission.
    -> I'm not paying for that
    Rafi: eye twitches Fine. I won’t be coming to this grocery sector again.
    -> Shouldn’t my manager give me that anyway? 
    Rafi: All Malmart items are sold separately, silly! 
    Rafi: How do you think you got that Malmart vest? 
    Rafi: It’s coming out of that paycheck!
===

title: General_Manager
---
Jerky is it? 
You’ll earn your last name as your title once you get promoted to General Manager, like me. 
I am a general manager
*salutes*. 
Under my supervision, you must do your job to the absolute top standard of the Malmart employee work code. 
Any exceptions, and you’re sent back to the bottom. 
Understand?
We offer a dynamic wage system.
Do good and your wage goes up.
Do bad and it goes straight to the bottom.
If it hit's zero, you're fired.
Oh! Make sure everyone gets their groceries done fast.
People are pretty impatient around here.
Don't fuck up!
*salutes*
===